'''Kool''' was a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. Kool was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] removed the [[MLG Box]] from the shop due to copyright reasons.
== Appearance ==
The knife is red with the  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kool-Aid_Man Kool Aid Man]'s face on the blade.

== Trivia ==
* The face on the blade of the knife is the Kool Aid Man.
*When the [[MLG Box]] was removed and temporarily replaced with the [[Chroma Box]], this knife had the Kool-Aid Man's face removed from the blade and was renamed [[Strawberry]].
*This, along with every other item in the [[MLG Box]], was removed from all player's [[Inventory|inventories]].

